<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#142238"><title>Browse listings | Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head>
<body><%- include('partials/navbar') %>
<main class="page-main"><section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">The campus board</span><h1>Browse lost &amp; found</h1><p>Look through recent reports from the Sherubtse College community. Contact details appear only when the poster chose to share them.</p></section><section class="listing-tools"><label class="search-box"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="item-search" type="search" placeholder="Search item, category, or location" aria-label="Search listings"></label><div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="Filter listings"><button class="filter-chip active" data-filter="all">All items</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="lost">Lost</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="found">Found</button><select id="category-filter" aria-label="Filter by category"><option value="">All categories</option><option>Electronics</option><option>ID cards &amp; wallets</option><option>Bags</option><option>Books &amp; notes</option><option>Keys</option><option>Clothing</option><option>Sports equipment</option><option>Other</option></select></div></section><p class="results-label" id="results-label" aria-live="polite">Loading listings…</p><div id="items-list" class="item-grid" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="items-empty" class="empty-state" hidden>No matching listings yet. Try another search or report the item.</div></main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
